    "created_at": "2026-05-26T06:48:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-26T06:48:53Z",
    "body": "It seems okay to me to organize this differently. I guess it would be @zcorpan's call. I'm not sure I agree that specifications should reflect implementations in general though. See also https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#algorithm-conformance.",
